Package: electron-runtime-42
Architecture: amd64
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, libnotify4, libxss1, libxtst6
Description: versioned shared Electron 42 runtime
 Electron combines Chromium and Node.js for desktop applications. This package
 installs the official Electron 42 Linux runtime in a versioned private path so
 compatible applications can share one runtime without conflicting with other
 Electron major versions.
 .
 This is unofficial community packaging and is not affiliated with Electron.
